{"id":"vod_sn_35541","vodId":"35541","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"柑橘味香气","name_cn":"柑橘味香气","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e93dd86822c54ab348f3f4639232259f.jpg"},"summary":"蓝原柚子（竹达彩奈 配音）是一名高中一年级的女生，外表看上去非常时尚的她，实际上却是一个内心里意外的天真，一点恋爱经验都没有的纯情女孩。由于家庭的原因，柚子进入了一所女子高中就读，这让柚子的心里非常不满，因为在这里，她能交到男朋友的概率简直微乎其微。　　刚刚入学的第一天，柚子便和学生会长芽衣（津田美波 配音）相遇了。芽衣是学校里公认的美人，无论是外表还是成绩还是家世都将其他的同龄人远远的抛在身后。柚子因为一场误会而对芽衣的影响极为糟糕，更糟糕的是，当她回到家里时发现，芽衣竟然成为了她的义姐，两人即将住进同一屋檐下。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Ce3tZgeuh71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/DtAGkwBndH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/NkzXGt52C31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/awbEMuyjNj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CJ3uurXcay1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/22a9xiAJMm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/u5Lmy0K8RL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6fVaQrgDqn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EGL3uPwg3h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nBFJqcJP2V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/X35kPgKQSq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sUxeFRWtMm1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:33.913Z"}